    <h2>One service account, Imperial + Pitco + Frymaster + Blodgett + TurboChef + Wells</h2>
    <p>The Middleby Corporation portfolio puts Imperial in the same parent foodservice family as a long list of LA-relevant commercial cooking brands. For operators running multi-Middleby kitchens — common in Middleby-spec dealer turnkey builds and operations where Imperial came in as part of a broader Middleby cooking package — one service relationship covers the full sibling list.</p>
    <p>Our Middleby family sibling coverage spans:</p>
    <ul class="check-list">
      <li><strong><a href="/brands/pitco-fryer-repair/">Pitco fryers</a></strong> — Middleby commercial fryer sibling.</li>
      <li><strong><a href="/brands/frymaster-fryer-repair/">Frymaster fryers</a></strong> — Middleby commercial fryer sibling, McDonald's OEM.</li>
      <li><strong>Blodgett deck and conveyor pizza ovens</strong> — Middleby pizza-equipment sibling.</li>
