    <p>For a mid-LA-market restaurant operator running Imperial IR-G ranges + Pitco fryers + Blodgett pizza ovens, that's one phone call to one service account covering three brands. Mom-and-pop service providers typically specialize in one brand at most; multi-Middleby coverage is structurally the territory of dedicated multi-brand commercial service operations like ours.</p>
    <p>The Middleby family positioning also matters operationally for parts logistics. Middleby's national distribution scale covers cross-brand parts when a single service call touches multiple Middleby siblings at the same kitchen. Imperial-specific Corona California parts compound with Middleby cross-brand inventory access — best of both: California factory proximity for Imperial items, Middleby national reach for everything else.</p>
